      "textEvidence": {
        "text": "This Equip Spell has one effect: while it stays face-up and is equipped to a legal face-up monster, that monster inflicts piercing battle damage when attacking a Defense Position monster. The damage is the positive ATK minus DEF difference and is dealt to the opponent of the attacking monster controller. It grants no ATK or DEF modifier and creates no activated effect, cost, target on attack, once-per-turn limit, special restriction, additional operation, or post-destruction trigger. Its initial equip selects one face-up monster; it leaves the field under ordinary equip rules if its target becomes invalid. A nonpositive difference deals no piercing damage.",
